    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=650 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up those peepers and hop your way out of this gloomy well!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=204 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/7697815c48a7fb369a61547782e77017.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=204 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/7697815c48a7fb369a61547782e77017.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/7697815c48a7fb369a61547782e77017.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ee2f1e01ed02f992e2bdcb4d27b9a675.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=204 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ee2f1e01ed02f992e2bdcb4d27b9a675.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ee2f1e01ed02f992e2bdcb4d27b9a675.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Platformer That Doesn\u2019t Mess Around</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies, no deaths\u2014just pure, unfiltered challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill and patience are the only things standing between you and glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/85baf669db4726a44f71d78316198a2f.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=650 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/85baf669db4726a44f71d78316198a2f.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/85baf669db4726a44f71d78316198a2f.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See Through the Shadows</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a dark world where your froggo\u2019s glowing eyes light the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to peek ahead\u2014those peepers are your trusty guide!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/cf1a767b424844391d641361e0955cd4.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/cf1a767b424844391d641361e0955cd4.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/cf1a767b424844391d641361e0955cd4.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slingshot-Style Jumping Shenanigans</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull back and launch your frog like a slingshot\u2014boing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your jumps with a crouch animation that shifts pixel-by-pixel and over 10 frames of glorious control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for a short, safe hop, yank hard for a wild leap, or angle it just right to thread the needle through tight gaps\u2014the possibilities are endless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slick physics engine means every tweak changes your fate, letting you tackle the same platform in a dozen dazzling ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch thousands of jump arcs with your fingertips and nail that perfect landing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Star of the Show</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-art so cute it\u2019ll make you forget how many times you\u2019ve faceplanted into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovable frog buddy on a hardcore adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/1d2fee6283289388e0e55964d6294dbe.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/1d2fee6283289388e0e55964d6294dbe.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/1d2fee6283289388e0e55964d6294dbe.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sing When the Going Gets Tough</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-struggle, treat yourself to your frog\u2019s \u201cribbit ribbit\u201d serenade\u2014available on demand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling beat? Belt out a tune and take a breather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messed up? No sweat\u2014kick back and regroup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/e81ef0bbedfb0ce53173ba545d358e96.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/e81ef0bbedfb0ce53173ba545d358e96.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/e81ef0bbedfb0ce53173ba545d358e96.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celebrate the Fall</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Took a tumble? Congrats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall is a spectacle: confetti bursts if you drop from high up, and a ghostly onlooker shows up to comment on your &quot;impressive&quot; leap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your downfall with an on-screen height-loss label\u2014because sometimes falling really far deserves its own scoreboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode for the Hop-Obsessed</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think the normal climb\u2019s too easy? Try doing it blind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hard Mode, your flashlight\u2019s gone\u2014no peeking, no previews. Just your memory, instincts, and raw skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only help? Your frog\u2019s natural glow shines a bit brighter... but don\u2019t expect it to save you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most daring frogs make it out alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to JumFrog\u2014a relentless gauntlet of challenges where even the tiniest slip-up can send you plummeting. This isn\u2019t for the faint of heart; it\u2019s a brutal test of skill that\u2019ll push you to your limits. But oh, the sweet, sweet taste of victory? Worth every heart-pounding second. Every jump\u2019s a thrill, every misstep a potential disaster\u2014talk about an adrenaline rush that\u2019ll keep you hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hold up, there\u2019s more to this than just hopping around. Where\u2019d this crown-wearing frog come from? Why\u2019s it snowing inside a well? What\u2019s waiting beyond the walls this little guy\u2019s so desperate to escape? And most importantly\u2014what\u2019s the deal with this mysterious pit? Buckle up, because this journey\u2019s got questions galore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In JumFrog, every jump is make-or-break. One wrong move, and all your hard work could croak in an instant. But don\u2019t let that scare you off! Every fall\u2019s a lesson, every retry a chance to sharpen your skills. You\u2019ll curse, you\u2019ll cheer, and you\u2019ll come out tougher than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in and see if you\u2019ve got what it takes to escape the well\u2014or at least figure out why there\u2019s a frog with a crown stuck in there!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=650 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/ed34975889d5c74934af93a323753d5a.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up those peepers and hop your way out of this gloomy well!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=204 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/dfca87c8e605253361489ed3409ef6fd.mp4?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/7697815c48a7fb369a61547782e77017.poster.avif?t=1755142676\" width=204 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227490/extras/7697815c48a7fb369a61547782e77017.webm?t=1755142676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea